    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNumber 61 Canterbrook is a stunning property that has been beautifully maintained and cared for by the current owner. It boasts ample living space and has been designed to cater to the needs of modern families.\nUpon entering the property, you are immediately struck by the bright and spacious nature of the ground floor. The large living room is perfect for entertaining guests, while the dining room is ideal for hosting family meals. The kitchen cum breakfast room is both practical and stylish, with plenty of storage and worktop space. A utility room provides additional storage space, while a multi-purpose room can be used as a second living space or ground floor bedroom. A guest wc completes the ground floor accommodation.\nThe first floor has been cleverly adapted to create a luxurious master bedroom suite with en-suite bathroom and two further bedrooms and a bathroom provide ample accommodation for a family.\nThe property benefits from a large front garden with off-street parking, while the large rear garden is perfect for outdoor entertaining. \nIn summary, Number 61 Canterbrook is a stunning property that combines style and practicality in equal measure. With ample living space, versatile accommodation and a large garden, it is the perfect family home."
      },
